    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clockwork Rabbit \u2013 a relaxing puzzle game with a level editor and time manipulation</h2>Clockwork Rabbit is a single-player, isometric puzzle game set in a steampunk world inhabited by... adorable bunnies!<br>Meet Tosia \u2013 a young mechanic working in a textile factory in Clockwork Town, where every room hides a new challenge.<br>The game blends time manipulation, action planning, helper robot programming, and a creative approach to puzzles. With no time limits on levels, you can play at your own pace and enjoy a laid-back experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747980/extras/8a652ce65f1a935827073c25bbc13249.poster.avif?t=1753896851\" width=613 height=691 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747980/extras/8a652ce65f1a935827073c25bbc13249.webm?t=1753896851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An independent artistic production</h2>Hand-drawn visuals inspired by the posters of Alphonse Mucha, Art Deco, and Art Nouveau styles turn every level into a small piece of art.<br>Theatrical, atmospheric music helps you stay focused and fully immersed in the game world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Charming, unobtrusive storytelling</h2>Uncover the narrative and the rich lives of the town's inhabitants \u2013 moving, surprising, and sometimes... a bit too human for rabbits.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747980/extras/3741dad1b5860e5f995f5bdf0ca8bdd0.poster.avif?t=1753896851\" width=600 height=455 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747980/extras/3741dad1b5860e5f995f5bdf0ca8bdd0.webm?t=1753896851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own levels!</h2>Clockwork Rabbit includes a built-in level editor that lets you design your own puzzles and share them with the player community.<br>Add obstacles, program sequences, play with logic and creativity \u2013 this is a game that doesn\u2019t end with the credits.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who is this game for?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Puzzle game enthusiasts<br></li><li>Fans of clever mechanics and time-based gameplay<br></li><li>Creative players looking for a title with a level editor<br></li><li>Those who enjoy a cute visual style, heartwarming characters, and gentle storytelling<br></li><li>Players who value indie games, unique atmosphere, and passion-driven development</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A calm and thoughtful puzzle experience<br></li><li>Single-player adventure with narrative background<br></li><li>Isometric perspective<br></li><li>Time manipulation mechanics<br></li><li>No violence, no ads, no microtransactions<br></li><li>Stylized visuals and a unique atmosphere<br></li><li>Full-featured level editor with sharing support<br></li><li>Suitable for both experienced and new players<br></li><li>Crafted with passion by an independent team</li></ul><br><strong>Jump into the rabbit hole with Tosia and try to catch that bunny!</strong><br><br>Some in-game texts were translated with the help of AI.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clockwork Rabbit \u2013 a relaxing puzzle game with a level editor and time manipulation</h2>Clockwork Rabbit is a single-player, isometric puzzle game set in a steampunk world inhabited by... adorable bunnies!<br>Meet Tosia \u2013 a young mechanic working in a textile factory in Clockwork Town, where every room hides a new challenge.<br>The game blends time manipulation, action planning, helper robot programming, and a creative approach to puzzles. With no time limits on levels, you can play at your own pace and enjoy a laid-back experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747980/extras/8a652ce65f1a935827073c25bbc13249.poster.avif?t=1753896851\" width=613 height=691 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747980/extras/8a652ce65f1a935827073c25bbc13249.webm?t=1753896851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An independent artistic production</h2>Hand-drawn visuals inspired by the posters of Alphonse Mucha, Art Deco, and Art Nouveau styles turn every level into a small piece of art.<br>Theatrical, atmospheric music helps you stay focused and fully immersed in the game world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Charming, unobtrusive storytelling</h2>Uncover the narrative and the rich lives of the town's inhabitants \u2013 moving, surprising, and sometimes... a bit too human for rabbits.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747980/extras/3741dad1b5860e5f995f5bdf0ca8bdd0.poster.avif?t=1753896851\" width=600 height=455 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747980/extras/3741dad1b5860e5f995f5bdf0ca8bdd0.webm?t=1753896851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own levels!</h2>Clockwork Rabbit includes a built-in level editor that lets you design your own puzzles and share them with the player community.<br>Add obstacles, program sequences, play with logic and creativity \u2013 this is a game that doesn\u2019t end with the credits.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who is this game for?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Puzzle game enthusiasts<br></li><li>Fans of clever mechanics and time-based gameplay<br></li><li>Creative players looking for a title with a level editor<br></li><li>Those who enjoy a cute visual style, heartwarming characters, and gentle storytelling<br></li><li>Players who value indie games, unique atmosphere, and passion-driven development</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A calm and thoughtful puzzle experience<br></li><li>Single-player adventure with narrative background<br></li><li>Isometric perspective<br></li><li>Time manipulation mechanics<br></li><li>No violence, no ads, no microtransactions<br></li><li>Stylized visuals and a unique atmosphere<br></li><li>Full-featured level editor with sharing support<br></li><li>Suitable for both experienced and new players<br></li><li>Crafted with passion by an independent team</li></ul><br><strong>Jump into the rabbit hole with Tosia and try to catch that bunny!</strong><br><br>Some in-game texts were translated with the help of AI.",
    "short_description": "Tessa is employed at a textile factory as a mechanic. Solve cozy time manipulation puzzles and unravel a charming story about rabbit mechanics.",
